  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"excerpt\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9640c3e5-5816-4447-9c11-b0a011e684eb\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"atlassian-macro-output-type\">INLINE</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>Configuring certain OpenMRS attributes such as users, patient attriibutes, locations, drugs, concepts and concept sets, etc. are required for every installation of Bahmni.&nbsp;Most OpenMRS <span>configuration </span>can be done using the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://192.168.33.10/openmrs/admin/index.htm\">OpenMRS&nbsp;Administration UI</a>.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c544fb19-d52f-4528-9374-f299f91b655c\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><span>Administrators can login with the admin user credentials to make necessary changes.&nbsp;</span></p><p>When OpenMRS starts up, the default admin password will be test. It is advised to change this password immediately in production environments to avoid unauthorised access.&nbsp;</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3>OpenMRS configuration</h3><p>Configuring the types/attribute below will be required for every installation of Bahmni.&nbsp;</p><ol><li>Users</li><li>Roles and Privileges</li><li>Locations</li><li>Visit Types</li><li>Encounter Types</li><li>Providers</li><li>Patient Attributes</li><li>Address Hierarchy</li><li>Relationships</li><li>Concepts and Concept Sets</li><li>Drugs</li><li>Order Types</li><li>Global Properties</li></ol></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f30abfd1-b7ec-4905-9c9a-751371b5f3c8\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">In this section</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"6d4d4185-75c0-4913-8626-225020e9e2d7\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
