    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><br/><span class=\"conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-name=\"excerpt\" data-macro-id=\"9640c3e5-5816-4447-9c11-b0a011e684eb\">Configuring certain OpenMRS attributes such as users, patient attriibutes, locations, drugs, concepts and concept sets, etc. are required for every installation of Bahmni.&nbsp;Most OpenMRS <span>configuration </span>can be done using the&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://192.168.33.10/openmrs/admin/index.htm\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenMRS&nbsp;Administration UI</a>.</span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c544fb19-d52f-4528-9374-f299f91b655c\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span>Administrators can login with the admin user credentials to make necessary changes. </span></p><p>When OpenMRS starts up, the default admin password will be test. It is advised to change this password immediately in production environments to avoid unauthorised access. </p></div></div><h3 id=\"OpenMRSconfiguration-OpenMRSconfiguration\">OpenMRS configuration</h3><p>Configuring the types/attribute below will be required for every installation of Bahmni. </p><ol><li>Users</li><li>Roles and Privileges</li><li>Locations</li><li>Visit Types</li><li>Encounter Types</li><li>Providers</li><li>Patient Attributes</li><li>Address Hierarchy</li><li>Relationships</li><li>Concepts and Concept Sets</li><li>Drugs</li><li>Order Types</li><li>Global Properties</li></ol></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f30abfd1-b7ec-4905-9c9a-751371b5f3c8\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>In this section</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"6d4d4185-75c0-4913-8626-225020e9e2d7\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945505/Configure+Address+Hierarchy\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945505\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Address Hierarchy</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945360/Configure+Person+Attributes\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945360\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Person Attributes</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/34013682/Configure+Users\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013682\" data-linked-resource-version=\"15\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Users</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945530/Configure+Visit+Types\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945530\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Visit Types</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/50921567/Configure+Concept+or+Concept+Set\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50921567\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Concept or Concept Set</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945591/Configure+Reference+Terms\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945591\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Reference Terms</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/47775905/Adding+Mappings+for+Concepts\" data-linked-resource-id=\"47775905\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Adding Mappings for Concepts</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945598/Configure+Programs\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945598\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Programs</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/18415840/Configure+Lab+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"18415840\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Lab Data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114727368/Configure+Medication+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114727368\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Medication Data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/50921519/Configure+Observation+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50921519\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Observation Form</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/50921523/Configure+Disposition+Concepts\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50921523\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Disposition Concepts</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945364/Configure+Advanced+Settings\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945364\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Advanced Settings</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/98402306/Configure+Locations\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402306\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Locations</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div><p> </p><p> </p><p> </p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
